    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chat with your PDFs, Word and PowerPoint files\n\n**Top:** paste document links in the form. The **Document to Markdown for AI & RAG** Actor on Apify converts each file to clean Markdown (tables, headings, OCR for scans) and splits it by heading into chunks with page numbers. The chunks go into a vector store.\n\n**Bottom:** ask questions in the chat. The assistant searches the chunks and cites file and page.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Add your OpenAI credential to the three OpenAI nodes.\n3. Open the form, add links, then open the chat.\n\nThe in-memory store is for testing. For production, swap **Store chunks** and **Search documents** for Pinecone, Qdrant, Supabase or PGVector.\n\nCost: about $0.002 per page on Apify (+$0.005 per scanned page with OCR).",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3ddf953b-a1d2-433a-b3ad-1692609c3d57",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        160
      ]
    }
